msgid ""
"Reusable shell commands for the current layout. On Linux they run through sh"
" -lc after you explicitly allow them. Shell commands run one at a time, with"
" a 30-second limit, in your home directory."
msgstr ""
"目前佈局的可重複使用 shell 指令。在 Linux 上，它們在您明確允許後透過 sh -lc 運行。 Shell "
"指令在您的主目錄中一次執行一個，時間限制為 30 秒。"

